    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Wolpert (1969) French Flag positional information, Tickle-Wolpert (1975) chick limb ZPA digit duplication, Ben-Zvi-Barkai (2010) scaling & 2D AER-FGF / ZPA-Shh limb bud paddle — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1431-1627) now returns 16 reference-anchored measurements: the 8 v2 metrics plus 2D wild-type digit count 3/3, 2D full-graft count 6/6, Tickle (1981) dose matches 4/4, Saunders/Summerbell segment matches 5/5, truncation-stage rho 1.0/1.0, Shh remaining after AER removal 5.7e-4 (ref 0), wild-type AER FGF P/A 1.56 (ref 1.0 null) and the 2D-vs-cosh RMSE 2.4e-3 (ref 0). Deductions: four of the new references are ordinal or null baselines (segment table with a +/- 1-stage caveat, dose levels chosen to span the classes, reference 0 for Shh loss, reference 1.0 for an asymmetry that is only qualitatively > 1), so they test ordering rather than magnitude (-6); no measurement compares the paddle's shape or L(t) with measured bud dimensions (-4)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
