            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-expansion-repression-scaled-blue-zone-fraction-across-hh18-hh28-l-180-660-um>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-wolpert-french-flag-morphogen-measurement-gallus-gallus-72h-embryo-specimen-radial-sdd-decay-length-lambda-px>,
